mindmap
  root((Unit 12<br/>Grammar))
    Indefinite Pronouns
      SOME-
        someone/somebody
        something
        somewhere
        Use: affirmative, offers
      ANY-
        anyone/anybody
        anything
        anywhere
        Use: questions, negatives
      NO-
        no one/nobody
        nothing
        nowhere
        Use: negative meaning
      EVERY-
        everyone/everybody
        everything
        everywhere
        Use: all/complete
    Reported Speech
      Structure
        said (that)
        told + person
      Tense Changes
        present → past
        past → past perfect
        will → would
        can → could
      Pronoun Changes
        I → he/she
        my → his/her
        you → I/we
      Time Changes
        today → that day
        yesterday → the day before
        tomorrow → the next day
        now → then
